Named cell types in the default atlas are public labels from the
adult Drosophila CNS literature (FlyWire, MaleCNS / Janelia).

`data/malecns_soma.bin` stores a 1,500-soma sample of MaleCNS v1
somaLocation points (HHMI Janelia and partners, CC BY 4.0),
axis-flipped into the shell frame. They are cell-body positions.

